Description:
For more than 50 years BITZER Electronics has developed and produced innovative electronic solutions for energy saving climate controls, for partners all over the world. 

BITZER Electronics control solutions are an important and reliable integrated part of our partners’ total system – and helps generating a perfect climate for humans and optimized storage of food in areas like: 

// Heat pumps 
// Air conditioning
// Commercial cooling
// Refrigeration units 
// Reefer containers 
// Compressors

